{
    "title": "Cheddar's Scratch Kitchen",
    "description": "Cheddar\u2019s new app makes ordering your scratch-made favorites easier than ever. Find real-time directions to a restaurant, browse the menu and place & save To Go orders, all with a snap (or tap) of your fingers. From our famous Chicken Tenders to Grilled Salmon, Ribs or Steak \u2013 all your comfort food classics are now just a click away. \r\n\r\nQuickly Order & Reorder To Go:\r\n- Easily order your favorites\r\n- Save your order in the app for later\r\n- Reorder your favorites with a tap\r\n\r\nFind Your Cheddar\u2019s:\r\n- Get real-time drive time to any location\r\n- See hours for dining-in and To Go ordering\r\n\r\nPayments & Gift Cards:\r\n- Save payment for future orders\r\n- Use, save and reload gift cards to your profile\r\n\r\nWe\u2019re always working on new features to keep the app the fastest, easiest path to the food you love. \r\n\r\nCheddar\u2019s Scratch Kitchen: Get a Lot. For not a Lot.\r\n\r\nHave a question?  Send it our way at Cheddars.com/contact-us.\r\n\r\nLegal:\r\nMust be 13+. Prices and participation may vary. View our online privacy notice at http://www.cheddars.com/privacy-policy. \r\n\r\n\u00a9 2020 Darden Concepts, Inc. All Rights Reserved.",
